<title>USA: NY bank discount window borrowings about $280 mln.</title>
<headline>NY bank discount window borrowings about $280 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The seven major New York City banks  borrowed about $280 million from the Federal Reserve's discount window on Wednesday, September 4, a Fed spokesman said.</p>
<p>It was the middle of the two-week bank maintenance period.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
